distinct from System`Diff.", "Notes", CellID -> 106009], 
     Cell["Diff is linear, has exterior degree +1, and applies the graded \
Leibniz rule to Wedge products. Ordinary exterior differentiation squares to \
zero.", "Notes", CellID -> 106010], Cell["Use ChangeExtD to change a \
connection and UseCartan to expand derivatives using structure equations or \
coordinate derivatives.", "Notes", CellID -> 106011], 
     Cell["Use Wedge, rather than Times, between forms of positive degree.", 
      "Notes", CellID -> 106012]}, Open]], 
